The '''Dragon's Lair''' is a location in {{zone|Galatea}} where players can buy the {{Item|Jade Dragon Pet|text=Jade Dragon Egg}}. It can be found in a cave at the bottom of the {{Zone|Murkwater Depths}} by swimming down a tunnel and taking every right turn.

