== Trivia ==
* The '''Jade Dragon''' is one of few [[NPC]]s that can talk despite being blocks: other similar [[NPC]]s are the [[Golden Dragon]] and [[Oruo the Almighty]].
* Purchasing a {{Item|Jade Dragon Egg}} for the first time awards the player with the {{AchievementLink|The Jade Dragon's Egg|ach=true}}.

